(text "OUTPUTS. All MCU enables gated by TPS3431 WDO (LVC1G08 for fuel/crank/glow, LVC541 OE for the rest). Fuel/crank: TPS48100 + 2x BSC070N10NS5 + 1mR shunt +\nINA281A2 from VBAT_ESTOP. Small outputs TPS1HTC30 from VBAT_P: ILIM 40.2k, SNS 1.1k -> TMUX1208 -> ADC. Readback via NPN to TCA9555 @0x23." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6d58d7d4-f237-4a37-bb2f-db85426e8b95"))
